Title:  We are wired to have friends

Seq:    12.6.38.1.3

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Christakis, Nicholas|Nicholas Christakis]], 2019, from the book *[[Blueprint: The Evolutionary Origins of a Good Society]]*

Timestamp: 20251013230959

Date Added: 2025-10-13 17:09:59 -0600

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Referenced In: Friendship - SS

Body:

We are wired to have friends, not just reproductive partners, and when we form friendships, we modify the social world around us in a way that makes friendliness useful. 

